ign:justify;font-family:Arial">It i\s activated when an individual establishes physical contact with the object for a period longer than 10 seconds, in which they start showing symptoms such as nausea, dizziness, weakness, sleepiness and audiovisual hallucinations, gradually increasing in i\ntensity the more time passes. At the end of the 10 seconds, the individual, in an unknown manner, is teleported to what can be described as a recreation of the events of the last battle of the war, in a limited space, confined to the Great Square, comple\tely destroyed at the time and littered with battle casualties from every party.</span></p></body>)/Rect[179.564 112.445 520.396 183.255]/Subj(Text Box)/Subtype/FreeText/T( )/Type/Annot>>endobj152 0 obj<</BS<</W 0>>/CA 1/Contents(V.E.T.A.L.A Protocol - The secret project SoÎnder envisioned, but ultimately discarded in real life. Consists of super attachments for the arms, legs and torso of a soldier, allowing him to carry multiply heavy weapons in just one arm. This prototype reme\mbrance consists of attachments for a Minigun \(Dif xd100 Individual + Block 1d6 Abilities\) on the upper part of the left arm, the lower having one Harpoon, and a Flamethrower \(Dif xd100 Area + Block 1d6 Abilities\) on the right arm's, with the lower pa\rt having another Harpoon \(Damage x2\). Also has a Jetpack to help with movement.)/DA(0 0 0 RG 0 0 0 rg /Helv 8 Tf)/DS(font: Helvetica,sans-serif 8.0pt; text-align:left; color:#000000 )/F 4/M(D:20240920182247-03'00')/NM(e5d6d6beb785412c93a0ea2c110921d7)/Page 2/RC(<?xml version="1.0"?><body xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml" xmlns:xfa="http://www.xfa.org/schema/xfa-data/1.0/" xfa:APIVersion="Acrobat:24.3.0" xfa:spec="2.0.2"  style="font-size:8.0pt;text-align:left;color:#000000;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal\;font-family:Helvetica;font-stretch:normal"><p dir="ltr">V.E.T.A.L.A Protocol - The secret project So&#235;nder envisioned, but ultimately discarded in real life. Consists of super attachments for the arms, legs and torso of a soldier, allowing him to car\ry multiply heavy weapons in just one arm. This prototype remembrance consists of attachments for a Minigun \(Dif xd100 Individual + Block 1d6 Abilities\) on the upper part of the left arm, the lower having one Harpoon, and a Flamethrower \(Dif xd100 Area\ + Block 1d6 Abilities\) on the right arm's, with the lower part having another Harpoon \(Damage x2\). Also has a Jetpack to help with movement.</p></body>)/Rect[178.909 28.1741 522.984 93.7841]/Subj(Text Box)/Subtype/FreeText/T( )/Type/Annot>>endobj153 0 obj<</BS<</W 0>>/CA 1/Contents(                                                                                                         Notes\r)/DA(0 0 0 RG 0 0 0 rg 0 Tc 0 Tw 100 Tz 0 TL 0 Ts 0 Tr /Helv 17.1 Tf)/DS(font: Helvetica,sans-serif 17.1pt; text-align:left; color:#000000 )/F 4/M(D:20240920172357-03'00')/NM(5f15e8eb9fc54a00959a0547e7205bd6)/Page 3/RC(<?xml version="1.0"?><body xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml" xmlns:xfa="http://www.xfa.org/schema/xfa-data/1.0/" xfa:APIVersion="Acrobat:24.3.0" xfa:spec="2.0.2"  style="font-size:17.1pt;text-align:left;color:#000000;font-weight:normal;font-style:norma\l;font-family:Helvetica,sans-serif;font-stretch:normal"><p dir="ltr"><span style="font-family:Helvetica">                                                                                                         Notes&#13;</span></p></body>)/Rect[275.215 668.469 326.62 726.619]/Subj(Text Box)/Subtype/FreeText/T( )/Type/Annot>>endobj154 0 obj<</BS<</W 0>>/CA 1/DA(0 0 0 RG 0 0 0 rg /Helv 10 Tf)/DS(font: Helvetica,sans-serif 10.0pt; text-align:left; color:#000000 )/F 4/M(D:20240915200158-03'00')/NM(d22bedd642ee4046b0d883ddb2b6cb22)/Page 3/Rect[67.0267 634.469 261.76 646.669]/Subj(Text Box)/Subtype/FreeText/T( )/Type/Annot>>endobj155 0 obj<</W 0.0>>endobj156 0 obj<</W 0.0>>endobj157 0 obj<</W 0.0>>endobj158 0 obj<</W 0.0>>endobj159 0 obj<</W 0.0>>endobj160 0 obj<